# Gem AI Agents → Claude Projects — Setup Pack

This pack turns each of your 27 Gemini 'Gem' agents into an individual Claude Project.

## How to set each one up - 
Request the pack from Jonathan Trillwood via LinkedIn 

1. In Claude.ai, go to the left sidebar → **Projects** → **+ New Project**.
2. Name the project using the suggested name in each file below.
3. Paste the **Description** into the project description field.
4. Open the project → **Custom Instructions / Project Knowledge** → paste the **Custom Instructions** block.
5. Save. Start a new chat inside that project and it will behave like the Gem did.

