## Notes
- These have been lightly cleaned up for Claude (removed Gemini-style bold-everything formatting) but the substance of every rule, template, and instruction is unchanged.
- A few agents reference uploading a CV/JD/CSV each time — with Claude Projects, you can instead add reusable reference files (e.g. a blank Greenhouse template, your Ocado benefits doc) to the Project's knowledge base so you don't have to re-upload them every chat.
- Agents that expect an Excel/CSV file (Recruitment Performance Analysis, TA Operations Analyst, Agentic Data Reporting) will work well in Claude since Claude can read and analyse spreadsheets directly in chat.
